; Scaled dot-product attention over bfloat16 operands as data: extents,
; strides, the binary32 scale and the key block, with the streaming
; reference the matrix engine's fused kernel is granted against. Pure: no
; Rivet, no SSA, no tensor type, so the SSA interpreter, a helper model and
; the model test's oracle share one definition. js_of_ocaml-safe: every
; extent and stride is an [int64].

